  "implementation": [
    "Existing JSON child visitor and admit_model charge the actual complete queued Value root and its nested storage/entries. Detailed status remains guarded through finite reply copying/construction; normal reply fields remain unchanged.",
    "Rejected metadata drops before queue publication and retains only a Copy publication status, plus the already admitted Prepared alias. Distinct static messages truthfully preserve saved/cancelled/failed outcomes; exclusive JSON adds no invented shared roots.",
    "If a successful save cannot retain its path/summary, the fallback explicitly states Export saved and omits the normal saved/path pair. Existing QML therefore renders the precise message without assigning an unavailable path. No presentation component rewrite or automatic retry.",
    "Production save still delegates the same native picker and public Rust save_with_format operation. A narrow injected-picker seam exercises actual filesystem publication/cancellation/no-overwrite without OS chooser automation.",
    "Current architecture pending lists remove already accepted input/error/product/batch/status owners while preserving historical feature/checklist evidence. No scientific/public API/binding/schema/dependency/registration or memory framework change."
  ],
